From 1a4203ab0e8d1a24477c3739e009b90ffb6d0d1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:44:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] VPVulkan: Vulkan 1.3 dynamic state and the remaining
 1.1-1.3 core commands

Dynamic state (Vulkan 1.3 / extended_dynamic_state, and the extended_dynamic_state3 subset in
every Alyx pipeline): viewport/scissor with count, cull mode, front face, topology (same class),
depth test/write/compare, stencil test/op/compare mask/write mask, depth bias enable, rasterizer
discard, primitive restart. Depth/stencil and cull reach Metal per draw (Draw::depthStencil /
Draw::cull; gpu/metal2 caches one MTLDepthStencilState per combination). Stencil compare/write
masks were ignored before. VK_DYNAMIC_STATE_COLOR_WRITE_MASK_EXT (2550 of Alyx's 3030 recorded
pipelines): Metal bakes write masks, so each mask combination is a pipeline variant requested on
first use (also recorded as a recipe); the pipeline's own mask uses the base pipeline.

New src/core13.cpp: vkCmd*2 copy commands, draw indirect count (count read at submit),
dispatch base, device groups of one, private data, external capability queries, tool properties,
maintenance4 requirement queries; promoted KHR/EXT/AMD names. VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state
advertised. Every 1.1-1.3 command resolves except YCbCr conversion and buffer device address
(features reported unsupported).

Tests: gpu_vulkan.pipeline (Alyx dynamic set, write-mask variant, cull FRONT_AND_BACK),
gpu_vulkan.sync (1.3 entry points resolve).

